PLACEHOLDER_SPLASH_SCREEN_FILE

This is a placeholder file. Replace with actual 1284x2778px PNG splash screen before app store submission.

For production, create a proper splash screen using:
- Apple Human Interface Guidelines for iOS
- Your brand colors and logo
- Minimal design with clear branding

Splash screen requirements:
- Size: 1284x2778 pixels (iPhone X sizing)
- Format: PNG
- Content: Logo, app name, or branding
- Background: Solid color or subtle gradient
- Safe zone: Avoid status bar and home indicator areas
